cosign.key
_build_*
output
_build-*/**
*_chunkah_*
*_rpm-ostree_*

# macOS / iCloud noise (this repo lives in an iCloud-synced folder)
.DS_Store
.iCloud*

# Python leaves these behind whenever a test suite imports one of the scripts in
# system_files/ or ingest/. They are machine-specific build junk, never shipped —
# build.sh rebuilds them inside the image and deletes ours.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The one library the app-icon drawings need (branding/icons/package.json asks
# for it). Downloaded with `npm --prefix branding/icons install`, never
# committed — see branding/icons/README.md. The LOCK FILE is committed, on
# purpose: it pins the exact version of fontkit, and fontkit is what turns the
# letters "DR" into a shape, so a different version could silently change the
# drawing of two icons.
branding/icons/node_modules/
